# portal-schedules has no secret in its environment (rule 7: every key is listed here, no value is a secret).
# Tokens are created inside the container and written to a mode-600 file, never to this file:
#   docker exec portal-schedules python -m sched.admin token-create NAME ROLE OUTFILE
# The HA reload webhook id lives in /srv/apps/homeassistant/secrets.yaml (HA side) and in
# /srv/apps/portal/applier/webhook-id (mode 600, applier side); neither is in git.
